## ENABLE I2C
1. Open pi prompt
2. sudo raspi-config
3. Navigate to Interface Options - I2C - Enable
4. sudo reboot
5. sudo apt install -y i2c-tools
6. i2cdetect -y 1
7. You should see the ADS1115 at address 0x48

## TEST USB WEBCAM
1. sudo apt install -y v4l-utils
2. v4l2-ctl --list-devices
3. The webcam should appear as /dev/video0 or similar
